# Denali refund orchestration

## Purpose

Connect **booking cancellation** to existing **`FinanceRefund`** (PR23-E2/E3) without duplicating money semantics.

Finance remains SoT for refund caps and lifecycle. Denali owns **eligibility policy** (penalty, cutoff). Bookings owns **lifecycle cancel** and capacity.

## DEN-PROD-08 — refund destination

**Launch:** manual payout only (`completeRefund` + `completionNote` / evidence). No Wallet, no PSP reversal.

## Eligibility ownership

| Layer | Owns |
| ----- | ---- |
| Denali `computeDenaliRefundEligibility` | Penalty %, suggested `eligibleRefundMinor` |
| Finance `refundable-cap` | Hard ceiling: collected − completed refunds |
| Orchestrator | `min(eligible, cap)` → `requestRefund` draft (`Requested`) |
| Operator | Approve + Complete payout in Finance Hub |

Penalty applies at **refund calculation**, not at cancel TX (DEN-PROD-09).

```text
eligibleRefund = max(0, collected − penaltyMinor − completedRefunds)
requestAmount  = min(eligibleRefund, financeCap)
```

## Orchestration trigger

After terminal cancel (`registration.cancelled` fact):

1. `runPostCancelSideEffects` — hold void, waitlist promote, settlement allocation trim
2. `orchestrateRefundAfterCancellation` — draft `FinanceRefund` when `requestAmount > 0`
3. Idempotency key: `refund:registration.cancelled:{domainEventId}`

**Never auto-Complete** — operator records offline payout in Finance.

## HTTP surfaces

| Method | Path | Actor |
| ------ | ---- | ----- |
| `GET` | `/bookings/:id/refund-eligibility` | Operator |
| `GET` | `/bookings/:id/member-cancellation` | Member (+ refund preview when paid) |
| `POST` | `/bookings/:id/member-cancellation/approve` | Operator (paid request path) |
| `POST` | `/tours/:tourId/cancel` | Operator (batch cancel + refund drafts) |
| Portal BFF | `GET /api/me/registrations/:id/refund` | Member refund status |

## Side effects matrix

| Cancel source | Capacity | Waitlist | Hold | Refund draft | Settlement |
| ------------- | -------- | -------- | ---- | ------------ | ---------- |
| Member withdraw | Freed if was approved | Promote one | Void | No (unpaid) | Trim allocation |
| Member self-cancel unpaid | Freed | Promote | Void | No | Trim |
| Member request (paid) | Held until ops approve | After approve | After approve | After approve | After approve |
| Operator cancel | Freed | Promote | Void | If collected > 0 | Trim |
| Tour cancel | Per registration | Per registration | Per reg | Per reg (no penalty) | Void tour settlements |
| Hold expiry | Freed | Promote | Expired | No | — |

## Financial invariants (delegated to Finance)

- `refund ≤ financeCap`
- No double refund (cap + idempotent request key)
- Immutable refund row; Complete is sole money gate
- Settlement/refund independence (DP-5)

## Verification

```bash
pnpm run test:dp6-refund-orchestration
```
